description: Pure game-engine package rules
globs: packages/game-engine/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Game engine

- Keep rules pure: movement, combat, quests, items, permissions.
- No imports from React, Fastify, Socket.IO, PostgreSQL, Drizzle, Render, or browser APIs.
- Accept an injectable random source so combat tests can be deterministic.
- Return domain results and events; do not persist or emit sockets here.
- Classic plain-text narration must remain available on significant events.
